    "finding": "Steady-state FPS is approximately 36 in both versions. Binary transport and resident-memory snapshots improve; the independent-document topology remains a limit.",
    "memoryCaveat": "PSS snapshots, not peak allocations or a sustained thermal test. One WebView renderer process was present after each dedicated-host restart; the after renderer was explicitly confirmed bound to the dedicated host through Android service records. Baseline association used the sole new WebView renderer observation.",
    "networkCaveat": "CDP Network.loadingFinished encodedDataLength for application/octet-stream responses. Includes HTTP overhead; excludes JavaScript and JSON and is not total application transfer or decoded heap size. Requests from eight documents are reported separately.",
    "startupCaveat": "Per-controller ready time excludes module imports before createAvatar. Ordering and shared browser/system caches are not fully controlled; these samples do not establish a universal cold-start multiplier.",
    "taskDurationCaveat": "CDP TaskDuration was almost identical across targets sharing one renderer thread; it is intentionally not summed or presented as independent per-avatar CPU."
